00:03:32.558 --> 00:03:34.939
and life and what was
the thought process,

00:03:34.939 --> 00:03:37.606
and the decision making
process you went through

00:03:37.606 --> 00:03:40.712
when you ultimately made a decision?

00:03:40.712 --> 00:03:43.178
- I think it's happened
more, unlike what I think

00:03:43.178 --> 00:03:45.484
you're going with your
question as you're younger,

00:03:45.484 --> 00:03:47.590
you may be in school,
there's a lot of options.

00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:50.488
You know, to me, I was
set at your age, right?

00:03:50.488 --> 00:03:52.932
I was, I mean, I barely went to college,

00:03:52.932 --> 00:03:54.912
I was like, I that badly wanted to go

00:03:54.912 --> 00:03:57.378
into the family business and do my thing.

00:03:57.378 --> 00:04:00.999
Where I started having
these things happen really

00:04:00.999 --> 00:04:03.571
is more of like the last
five to seven year phenomenon

00:04:03.571 --> 00:04:06.553
where I'm crippled by business options.

00:04:06.553 --> 00:04:07.844
Do I want to be a venture capitalist,

00:04:07.844 --> 00:04:11.122
do I want to start companies,
do I want to do more econ,

00:04:11.122 --> 00:04:12.793
do I want to do TV shows?

00:04:12.793 --> 00:04:15.197
Like, I've had a lot
of options in the last

00:04:15.197 --> 00:04:17.658
five to seven years, and I think for me,

00:04:17.658 --> 00:04:21.743
you know, what I like to do
is run on two parallel paths.

00:04:21.743 --> 00:04:23.618
So, here's my piece of advice.

00:04:23.618 --> 00:04:26.516
One, I'm constantly debating them, right?

00:04:26.516 --> 00:04:27.780
I mean, you just have
to, you're a human being,

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:29.410
you're thinking about your options.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.618
But I'm always doing something.

00:04:31.618 --> 00:04:33.447
I think the thing that bothers me

00:04:33.447 --> 00:04:37.047
is that people are
crippled by their options,

00:04:37.047 --> 00:04:39.351
and then actually aren't
doing anything in parallel,

00:04:39.351 --> 00:04:41.850
they're lollygagging while they decide,

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:44.834
and to me, whatever you're deciding,

00:04:44.834 --> 00:04:46.670
given that these should
all be loaded questions,

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:49.199
whatever is in your option
point, you need to be doing.

00:04:49.199 --> 00:04:50.770
Right, you need to be executing.

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:52.803
So, if there's three
or four tangible things

00:04:52.803 --> 00:04:54.410
going on in your mind,
you need to make sure

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:57.964
your internships, your
free time, you know,

00:04:57.964 --> 00:05:01.133
whatever you can do to let you taste them

00:05:01.133 --> 00:05:03.797
and get context around them
is what really matters.

00:05:03.797 --> 00:05:04.707
- Sweet.

00:05:04.707 --> 00:05:05.410
- That's it, good.

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:06.484
- Awesome.
- I thought there was

00:05:06.484 --> 00:05:07.277
gonna be a follow up.

00:05:07.277 --> 00:05:09.344
- Oh, in terms of that, I mean,

00:05:09.344 --> 00:05:11.115
that makes a lot of sense, just...

00:05:11.115 --> 00:05:12.753
- It's about execution, right?

00:05:12.753 --> 00:05:15.313
Like, to me, what I was
doing was I showed up

00:05:15.313 --> 00:05:18.216
